    <dcterms:identifier>MAYA-EDU-0175</dcterms:identifier>
    <edu:applicabilityNotes>Directly developed for adolescents (from age 14–16) and young adults (around age 18) transitioning from paediatric to adult oncology care. Applies specifically to AYA survivors of childhood or adolescent cancers rather than those diagnosed in adult care settings. Clinic listings and care pathways are specific to Germany.</edu:applicabilityNotes>
