    <dcterms:description>Patient guide to life after initial cancer treatment, covering follow-up, cardiovascular and other late effects, physical activity, nutrition, smoking cessation, emotional wellbeing, relationships, support services and personal care records.</dcterms:description>
    <edu:applicabilityNotes>Broad adult survivorship guide. Direct participants to relevant sections. Clinical review should confirm the continuing applicability of recommendations in this 2017 edition, particularly lifestyle and treatment advice.</edu:applicabilityNotes>
    <dcterms:publisher>European Society for Medical Oncology (ESMO); European Cancer Patient Coalition (ECPC); developed in collaboration with the International Psycho-Oncology Society (IPOS)</dcterms:publisher>
