    <icare:knowledgeResourceHasAudience rdf:resource="https://w3id.org/icareonto/CaregiverAudience"/>
    <edu:applicabilityNotes>General oncology guide, not AYA-specific. Includes malnutrition and symptom-management advice for active treatment that should not be applied indiscriminately to well survivors. For post-treatment users, prioritise the relevant section and their current nutritional needs. Dietary supplements and individual dietary treatment require professional advice.</edu:applicabilityNotes>
    <edu:journeyStage>After treatment / survivorship</edu:journeyStage>
    <edu:journeyStage>During treatment</edu:journeyStage>
